        "TileImage": "$($repository aea627fe-c096-4bcf-9552-ed25f31dd973).Image",
        "Description": "2/6\rHello, 47. Good job in the Maldives. The next contract is ready for you. The client, K.S. has paid us and given us the names of two leaders. You have two targets, they are the Hoffman couple. Alexander and Marie Hoffman own a pharmaceutical company together. They are also both part of the organization&apos;s board. The Hoffmans arrived this morning at a luxury hotel in Thailand. We&apos;ll be in touch when you have completed the mission. Good luck.",
